Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sagatua Tako
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm going\Nto be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know what I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.42,0:01:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sad to think that someone could be so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,depressed it takes over their entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.54,0:01:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Matt, these feelings of dread\Ntook the form of a deep black cave,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.02,0:01:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he was about to be lost in it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.24,0:01:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon finally opened Matt's eyes\Nand proved that he was really loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.10,0:01:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora had a similar problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Matt and Joe were able to pull\Nher out of her own cave of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai and Lord Greymon had been\Nholding off Piedmon all on their own,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they were completely exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.46,0:02:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the power from\NMatt's crested friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they became re-energized,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and should be able to take care of\Nthat clapping fool once and for all.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}The Holy Swordsman! HolyAngemon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we have two Mega Digimon,\Nlet's destroy Piedmon once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.48,0:02:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him, MetalGarurumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, WarGreymon,\Ntake care of this clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'm a clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll act like one, clown trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try jumping through this hoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're having a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry if I call to a balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.04,0:02:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Round and round he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where he lands, nobody knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.02,0:02:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks this is just a big game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.26,0:02:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm tired of playing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:02:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:02:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants us to make a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:02:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.90,0:03:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't want to play with\NUncle Piedmon anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tear all the swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.42,0:03:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, some of those\Nswords aren't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Greymon, I'm picking up\Nthe real swords on my sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over to your right, cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old wolf snout.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the joke's on you, Piedmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gaia Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright! Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, have everyone digivolve and attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.46,0:03:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's our turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A white flag?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's trying to surrender to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's got another\Ntrick up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.94,0:03:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you make\Nyourself disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Playtime is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know! Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming next shows at 7.30!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been a great crowd!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.35,0:04:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made them all disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least he didn't\Nsell them in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.72,0:04:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do to tie and met, Patamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hold the keys to their existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I need a place to put them,\Nso I made a couple of keychains.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll hang these\Ntwo on my backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of sicko turns\Npeople into keychains?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a sicko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a collector, and these new items\Nhave such sentimental value to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, who wants me next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.48,0:05:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all this fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't bring a single marshmallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Centarumon, I came as fast as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.76,0:05:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Gennai, I'm glad you\Nmade it. Is this it? Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is the mystical wall of fire the\Nancient prophecy on File Island describes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.78,0:05:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say we barbecue?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it really true that he had\Nto make it across these flames?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it sounds crazy, Gennai,\Nbut that's what the prophecy says.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, get into that cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.47,0:05:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll hold him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.10,0:05:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Viking Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here, Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:06:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon's buying us more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of place is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a giant circus tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's a way out across this canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only question is, how do we get to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way is to use these\Nswings like a trapeze artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.38,0:06:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't let down, there's no net.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, hold me tight and don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so easy to fly, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.24,0:06:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you carrying in\Nthat backpack? Bricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, Gatomon, you've got to trim your claws
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Away you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to take your friend along?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.76,0:07:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon, go Izzy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.78,0:07:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Izzy. I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you see them and now you\Ndon't. They're dropping like flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, I'm getting exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.95,0:07:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.87,0:07:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel fresh as a daisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, get up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the battle's started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.22,0:07:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally bring all the reinforcements\Nand all they want to do is hang around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, my name is Izzy and I'm very smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I didn't know how to stop me and\Nmy friends from being made into kitchens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itchins!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.87,0:07:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love a good puppet show!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you want to play\Nhide and go seek, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I love a good game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:08:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see, if I were a little\Npest, where would I hide, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're in this room over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we're out of danger for now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K., come here. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:09:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to take Kari\Nand get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, there isn't much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piedmon has the rest of our friends\Nand if he gets us, we're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.24,0:09:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK please you're the only one who\Ncan protect Kari you have to be
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be brave now, get going. I won't leave\Nyou. Don't worry about me. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right no matter what happens\Njust keep running Okay Sora I promise
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever I can to protect Kari\NRight hurry go come on Kari let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, I want to stay and fight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.62,0:09:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.76,0:09:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't even Digivolve without\NJoe, so go before Patamon gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Sora! Go, Mammon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe risked his neck to protect us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.20,0:09:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and if Patamon turns you into a doll,\Nhis sacrifice will mean nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, please help TK and Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:09:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only need five more keychains for my\Ncollection and then I'll have the whole set.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not if I can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zara!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.26,0:10:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to succeed, sometimes you\Nhave to step on people along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.80,0:10:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just ran out of room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.86,0:10:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the escape line I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away! Can we jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.02,0:10:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the dead end!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a kitten like your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to climb down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.12,0:11:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too high, T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we slip, we're goners.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, we're going to have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, T .K., where'd\Nthat basket come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who put that there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can use it to climb down\Nthe side of the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were\Na snake charmer, T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think we should climb it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.24,0:11:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom always said never take\Ncandy or rope from strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to climb it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.24,0:11:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora told me to be brave\Nno matter how scared I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.14,0:11:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.05,0:11:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go first. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.86,0:11:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretend you're in gym class.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must quit this, it costs\Nme a fortune in new doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, I'll distract him. Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anjima.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get him, Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't shake him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.44,0:12:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't shake him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drop zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.32,0:12:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.82,0:12:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.50,0:13:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.41,0:13:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Kari's afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let her see that I am too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon will be fine, but\Nyou've got to keep on climbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let that Joker Poromon scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.92,0:13:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've reached the end of your rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry if I gave you a witty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go, Kari, or he'll get you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I won't let you go, T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.44,0:13:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you two are\Nfalling for each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K., Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I let you do,\NMatt. Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:13:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, what would he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, don't ever give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.94,0:14:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it won't help if you\Ndon't have faith in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.66,0:14:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, you\Nhave to fight to the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you, Matt, I'll\Nnever give up the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't do it, then this world\Nand our world will be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do it for Matt,\Nfor Angemon, for everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, you digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.96,0:14:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, you digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiball 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.40,0:14:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.30,0:14:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magnum Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.10,0:15:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Digimon! Hey Digimon! Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you could Digiball!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.98,0:15:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Digimon! Hey Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am MagnaAngemon.
