Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.77,0:15:29.74,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.77,0:15:29.74,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.77,0:15:29.74,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Archangel Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.77,0:15:29.74,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.77,0:15:29.74,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Heaven's Gate
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.84,0:15:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have eight shining\Nwings and a beam shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.40,0:15:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wield the mighty sword Excalibur.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my devastating attack\Nis the Gate of Destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chew on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.96,0:15:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess my sword trumps yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to bring our friends back\Nto normal, Magna Antidote!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.14,0:16:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a weird dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had an incredible\Nurge to carry some keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did a great job, T.K.\NIf it wasn't for your
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,advice I don't think\NI would have been able
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.94,0:16:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To do it. Huh? Wow, when\Ndid Angemon Digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you look great turn around let me see very
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.70,0:16:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well so those did you\Njust didn't think the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dark masters are that\Neasily defeated hmm well
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guess again you're not\Nthe only ones with an
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an army of\Nfriends that can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is more fun than a\Nbarrel of flying monkeys.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.06,0:16:44.02,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Evilmon{\b0}
