Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.06,0:16:44.02,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Virus
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.06,0:16:44.02,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Small Demon Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.06,0:16:44.02,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.06,0:16:44.02,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Nightmare Shock
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digidestined, meet the Flymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their nightmare shock will\Ngive you a rude awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, we can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, toughen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm with you, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only chance is if we all\Ncombine our powers together,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.10,0:16:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the problem is we're still\Nmissing some of our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:16:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.75,0:17:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we're late. It's Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we too late for the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pummel what!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.78,0:17:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sliced.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm gonna have\Nto work on my swing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.24,0:17:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, gang, give them\Nthe full Digimon attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Thunder Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.62,0:17:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horn Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pummel wha!
