Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.36,0:18:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.94,0:18:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.50,0:18:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karbuterimon Digimon 2
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Mid to openாaguterimon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.62,0:18:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most Impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.72,0:18:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trump Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horn Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.19,0:18:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flower! Yada!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Celestial Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great Flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gate of Destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, no, no
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, remember us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.44,0:19:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terra Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gigamissile!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.26,0:19:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last remnants of Sapporo\NMountain are disappearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Master's control over\Nthe digital world is finally gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:19:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:01.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.82,0:20:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.94,0:20:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.52,0:20:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm starting to think we have\Na strange-looking group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might not have\Nthe best fashion sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they're the best\Nfriends we've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.68,0:20:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have email from Gennai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.51,0:20:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it say, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not now. I need a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he congratulating us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.48,0:20:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gennai says here that the Dark\NMasters aren't the real enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says here that the real enemy\Nis an evil force whose very
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.36,0:20:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,existence warped the Digi-World\Nand created the Dark Masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.66,0:20:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So according to this, I don't think\Nwe're out of the woods quite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.22,0:20:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's not the Dark Masters,\Nthen who do we fight next?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.44,0:20:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.96,0:20:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.46,0:21:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be able to get the courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my heart I'm going to be able to see\Nmy heart. I'm going to be able to see my.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.94,0:22:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,future I'm going to be able
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.68,0:22:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.20,0:22:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.11,0:22:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La, la, la, la,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,la, la, la, la,
